    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it. But specifically regarding the data processing patent—the big one. Nebula's due diligence team is going to dig into the litigation filings. How do we handle the fact that there's a legal challenge active on that patent right now? We can't let them use that to tank the $1.2B valuation.",
