      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Misrepresenting a high-risk legal challenge as a \"routine review\" is highly deceptive and could immediately violate disclosure obligations, leading to a deal collapse and potential legal trouble. Instead, frame it as \"under active, high-level strategic review, with a robust plan to defend the claim based on foundational prior art documentation.\" This approach is honest but carefully controlled, showing you are managing the risk proactively rather than hiding it.",
